    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE FIRST EPISODE IS FREE TO PLAY</h2><br>ECHO OF FEAR is a psychological horror game where you play as a detective who receives a box containing 6 mysterious videotapes. Each tape represents a separate story connected by a common plot. The plot is based on the Cthulhu myths by H.P. Lovecraft.<br>You are watching the first part of the ECHO OF FEAR anthology.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125970/extras/2f58b9159be930c6022bde210a0fe1c0.poster.avif?t=1736688113\" width=544 height=306 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125970/extras/2f58b9159be930c6022bde210a0fe1c0.webm?t=1736688113\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3125970/extras/2f58b9159be930c6022bde210a0fe1c0.mp4?t=1736688113\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ECHO OF FEAR: Vol.1 Night Visit</h2>In the first episode of &quot;ECHO OF FEAR,&quot; the detective watches a videotape titled &quot;Night Visit.&quot; You play as Louis Langridge, who decides to take a shortcut to the city of Arkham via a country road. But when a rainstorm begins, he seeks shelter in a lonely house. What could go wrong?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>This game is a first-person narrative walking simulator with item carrying and exploration mechanics.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\">[]Atmospheric environment and photorealistic graphics.[]Each episode's story is part of a larger puzzle.[]VHS movie and old film atmosphere.[]Spatial puzzles.</ul>",
